  "findings": [
    "A does not improve first-round heldout success: it fixes5 old collisions but introduces10; four layouts regress and one improves.",
    "The net five-success deficit is concentrated in the initial-z.5m stratum: old32/38 versusA27/38. Across remaining122cases both have109successes. Six of10 A-only collisions start at.5m, versusone of5 A-only successes. This is a correlation in this fixed sample, not proof altitude causes collisions.",
    "New A failures mostly occur after sustained flight: mean15.33s,9of10 later than5s. There are no timeouts or numerical failures. Thus the main measured failure is collision avoidance/trajectory outcome, rather than crashes from immediate numeric instability.",
    "Regressions are not explained by faster average flight: A is slower on the131 mutually successful episodes and its10 new collisions have mean commanded speed.761m/s. Six new collisions are in command range[.5,.75). Longer routes are harder for both; all43 cases with initial distance under4m succeed for both.",
    "Available records contain initial/goal altitude but no collision position, final altitude, minimum clearance or per-step depth/action trajectory. They cannot distinguish ground contact, pillar/floater contact, delayed braking or terminal hovering as the causal mechanism.",
    "Old selected actor lineage233.472M transitions differs from fresh A122.88M plus prior geometry/curriculum history. This is not an isolated aligned-PPO versus legacy ablation, so lower A success does not establish that semantic alignment caused regression."
  ],
  "limits_and_round2_use": {
    "sampling": "Only five generated layouts,32 paired starts/goals each; episodes share map geometry. Descriptive bins are post-hoc and correlated. No independent-map significance or general causal claim.",
    "randomness": "Starts, goals, controller parameters, initial wind/thrust and maps match exactly. Subsequent stochastic draws follow the same laws but can diverge after policy-dependent reset progression.",
    "deployment": "Round1 A was not promoted; frozen old deployment remains.",
    "phase2": "Existing fixed-parameter exact A resume to twice its original budget is unchanged by this analysis. Seeds431..435 are historical; future441..445 remain blind. Do not select parameters using either observed failure bins or future blind outcomes.",
    "other_ablations": "Larger-environment/radius development results are already recorded in selection-lock.json; not reinterpreted here."
  },
